{"author": "raymond91125", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete [GO:0070973](https://www.ebi.ac.uk/QuickGO/term/GO:0070973) protein localization to endoplasmic reticulum exit site\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/19122\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Dc-DTgrPEsAhrVSwClsvIoNTtrnxRGkxhExWGNDNnW0\n\nImpacted groups: \nGeneDB 1\nMGI 2\n~SGD 1~\n~WB 1~\n~UniProt 7~\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \nGO:0070973\tunirule2go\tUniRule:UR001349783 > protein localization to endoplasmic reticulum exit site\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2026-05-26T23:56:41Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to GO:0070973 protein localization to endoplasmic reticulum exit site", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-06-05T19:07:32Z"}
